WEBVTT

00:35.640 --> 00:36.280
General

00:36.360 --> 00:37.400
They retreated too quickly

00:37.480 --> 00:38.880
Didn't catch them all

00:41.040 --> 00:42.440
Prince of Jin

00:42.760 --> 00:44.400
That rabbit emperor in the south

00:44.480 --> 00:45.960
Has raised a wolf

00:47.400 --> 00:48.960
Just lost some tents

00:49.280 --> 00:50.947
General Shi's fifty thousand troops

00:51.080 --> 00:51.960
No matter how he schemes

00:52.120 --> 00:52.920
It's just

00:53.000 --> 00:54.400
A breeze brushing fur

00:54.480 --> 00:55.880
What do you know?

00:56.560 --> 00:57.960
When two armies fight

00:58.120 --> 00:59.520
It's all about momentum

01:00.640 --> 01:01.400
The Xuan people's arrows

01:01.480 --> 01:04.040
Have almost all been used on the refugees

01:04.120 --> 01:04.960
Call the craftsmen

01:05.040 --> 01:06.440
The finished catapults

01:06.920 --> 01:07.400
At dawn

01:07.520 --> 01:08.560
Send two units

01:08.640 --> 01:09.600
To attack the city in rotation

01:09.680 --> 01:10.520
On the other side

01:10.600 --> 01:12.000
Work faster too

01:12.120 --> 01:13.520
Yes

01:21.280 --> 01:22.400
Send people out of the city

01:22.480 --> 01:23.760
To recover arrows as much as possible

01:23.840 --> 01:24.560
At the same time

01:24.640 --> 01:26.040
Open the southern grain storehouse

01:26.120 --> 01:28.080
Reward our troops for the successful raid

01:28.160 --> 01:29.400
Have the soldiers

01:29.480 --> 01:30.880
Celebrate together

01:31.480 --> 01:32.880
Yes

01:35.600 --> 01:36.400
This General Zhu

01:36.480 --> 01:37.680
Truly has the courage of a bear and tiger

01:37.760 --> 01:38.840
I saw in the Wuzhao camp

01:39.000 --> 01:40.000
Flames reaching the sky

01:40.080 --> 01:40.960
Truly satisfying

01:41.040 --> 01:41.800
Pity

01:41.880 --> 01:42.760
Only good food

01:42.840 --> 01:44.120
No wine

01:44.200 --> 01:44.920
I think

01:45.000 --> 01:46.320
This meal is like a last meal

01:46.400 --> 01:47.800
Zhu Yuanzhi showed off

01:48.400 --> 01:49.800
Won't the Wuzhao retaliate?

01:49.960 --> 01:51.480
Maybe they'll launch a full attack tonight

01:51.560 --> 01:52.880
Lately I

01:52.960 --> 01:53.920
Can't sleep well

01:54.000 --> 01:54.600
Always hear

01:54.680 --> 01:56.080
Thumping sounds

01:56.480 --> 01:57.760
Always dream of Wuzhao warhorses

01:57.840 --> 01:59.240
Trampling down on me

01:59.400 --> 02:00.680
Shut up and eat

02:00.760 --> 02:01.360
Stop thinking about this and that

02:01.480 --> 02:02.880
Scaring yourself

02:14.960 --> 02:16.520
Although we've repelled the enemy

02:16.600 --> 02:18.000
But arrows are exhausted

02:18.320 --> 02:20.320
All kinds of weapons and traps

02:20.480 --> 02:21.880
Are also severely depleted

02:22.040 --> 02:22.600
Also

02:22.680 --> 02:24.200
Need to immediately assign people

02:24.280 --> 02:26.280
To urgently repair the city walls

02:26.920 --> 02:28.040
How many men do we have left?

02:28.120 --> 02:28.960
Heavy casualties

02:29.040 --> 02:31.400
Now only about two thousand can still fight

02:31.480 --> 02:32.480
If the Wuzhao attack again

02:32.560 --> 02:33.960
At most we can

02:34.280 --> 02:35.400
Hold for two days

02:35.480 --> 02:36.880
Report

02:37.920 --> 02:38.600
There's an army to the south

02:38.680 --> 02:39.920
Approaching us

02:40.000 --> 02:41.667
They don't look like Wuzhao

02:42.000 --> 02:43.667
Chen Ying's reinforcements have arrived

02:44.480 --> 02:46.147
Let's go take a look

03:06.880 --> 03:08.400
Who goes there?

03:10.360 --> 03:11.840
I'm Liu Dadao

03:12.080 --> 03:14.320
Commander of Yong'an Garrison's Left Army

03:15.200 --> 03:16.280
These

03:16.360 --> 03:18.800
Are all the lords of northern fortresses

03:19.360 --> 03:20.320
Zhang, Huang, Liu, Li

03:20.400 --> 03:21.360
The four great families

03:21.520 --> 03:22.880
Have also come

03:23.280 --> 03:24.680
Although we're in the north

03:24.760 --> 03:25.760
In our hearts

03:25.840 --> 03:28.507
We always recognize the Xuan on this flag

03:28.680 --> 03:31.680
Everyone heard the royal army is trapped in Yiyang

03:31.840 --> 03:33.800
Specially led the northern volunteer army

03:33.880 --> 03:35.280
To come and help

03:39.480 --> 03:40.800
Great Xuan's old subjects

03:40.880 --> 03:42.440
Great Xuan's old subjects

03:42.640 --> 03:44.640
Willing to die for Great Xuan

03:44.760 --> 03:47.000
Willing to die for Great Xuan

03:47.200 --> 03:48.200
It's reinforcements

03:48.280 --> 03:49.680
Our reinforcements

03:52.600 --> 03:53.480
Your Highness

03:53.560 --> 03:54.760
Look

